  "_readme": [
    "Routing metadata, NOT content. The KB prose is authored in the SalesIQ UI and",
    "remains the single source of truth for what is true; this file only records the",
    "ways visitors ask for each article. It lives in the repo so it can be diffed,",
    "tested and reviewed, and so `npm run kb:export` never overwrites it.",
    "",
    "Rules enforced by lib/bot/answers.test.ts:",
    "  - every key must be a real article id in kb-snapshot.json",
    "  - an alias must not be claimed by two different articles",
    "  - single-word aliases must be distinctive (agent names, product names)",
    "",
    "An alias matches on the whole normalised query, or as a contained phrase, and",
    "short-circuits scoring. Keep them specific: a vague alias hijacks better matches."
  ],

